  "_comment": "Nonogram screenshot capture. Per May 2026 rule: no shop, no more-games, no settings — every slot shows actual gameplay at distinct content. Uses JS-based showScreen/startLevel rather than tap coordinates so the same config works across phone, tablet_7, and tablet_10.",
